<title>MOLDOVA: Moldovan leu falls to 4.667 per dollar.</title>
<headline>Moldovan leu falls to 4.667 per dollar.</headline>
<dateline>CHISINAU 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Moldovan leu fell to 4.667 to the dollar on the Moldovan Interbank Currency Exchange from 4.660 on Wednesday.</p>
<p>				    Nov 14		  Nov 13</p>
<p> lei per dollar		 4.667		   4.660</p>
<p> volume traded ($)	    900,000		 150,000</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
